Applies to plant at develop (96941d3b). Adds counters for the five
prepare_collar_solve early exits and the pinned-at-bracket-endpoint case, dumped to
stderr on process exit when PLANT_LEAF_CENSUS is set. Report 02 section 3 records
the measurements.

develop's plant does not compile against the installed odelia as of this writing:
odelia/ode_util.hpp:62 calls xad::value with no XAD include, so control.cpp fails on
the first TU reaching plant/control.h -> odelia/ode_control.hpp -> odelia/ode_util.hpp.
Workaround used: append to plant/src/Makevars
    PKG_CPPFLAGS += -include XAD/XAD.hpp
